[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scenes/enemies/ranged_minion.gd" id="1_ranged"]

; The "needle man" (Minion2_Berserk). Designer, 2026-07-25: shoots more often
; and stays further out. attack_interval 1.0 -> 0.5 doubles its rate of fire;
; attack_range 100 -> 340 means it opens up from well outside melee, and
; Combatant.RANGED_STANDOFF_FRACTION (0.6) makes it back away once a hero
; closes inside ~204px, so it kites instead of being walked down.
; detect_range is multiplied by Minion.DETECT_RANGE_MULT (2.2) at spawn, so
; 200 here becomes 440 live — comfortably past attack_range so it engages at
; its full reach rather than having to walk into range first.
